@prefix inf: <https://influence.shapething.com/ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/> .

### Every property of an entity in the modal - a person, a work or a concept - below the rest: a
### second renderer. Its data is what Wikidata states about the entity (see
### src/queries/allProperties.rq). The shape has no target: the modal names it for the entity, and
### the renderer's enableMissingShapesGeneration gives it a property for every predicate of the
### entity that it does not ignore. The external identifiers are not in the data at all: the query
### leaves them out.

inf:AllPropertiesShape
    a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:label "All properties"@en ;
    # The full name (P1559, already inf:fullName), the page banner (P948, the banner of the
    # modal, see src/components/Modal), and the coordinates beside the coordinate location (P625)
    # - the extreme points, the geographic center, the place depicted, the sandbox - which would
    # each be one more map.
    sh:ignoredProperties (
        wdt:P1332 # coordinates of northernmost point
        wdt:P1333 # coordinates of southernmost point
        wdt:P1334 # coordinates of easternmost point
        wdt:P1335 # coordinates of westernmost point
        wdt:P5140 # coordinates of geographic center
        wdt:P626 # Sandbox-Geographic coordinates
    ) .
